 ```
 
+By default, checkboxes are stacked but if you prefer them inline:
+
+```js
+const uiSchema = {
+  "ui:widget": {
+    component: "checkboxes",
+    options: {
+      inline: true
+    }
+  }
+};
+```
+
 See the "Arrays" section of the playground for cool demos.
 
 ### Autogenerated widget ids
